1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:05,990
In Singapore, the boss of the most valuable company on Earth is having dinner with a Chinese spy.

2
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:08,430
He's Jensen Huang, who runs NVIDIA.

3
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:12,870
She's Alice Huang, no relation, and she runs one of his biggest customers.

4
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:14,690
But here's the strange part.

5
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:18,010
Somewhere nearby, American agents are taking pictures.

6
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:20,190
They know exactly who she is.

7
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:21,930
Jensen has no idea.

8
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,150
To our customers.

9
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,230
To friends.

10
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:31,830
Under that table, her company is buying billions of dollars of his chips, the kind China isn't allowed to have.

11
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:37,070
This is the story of how China got a spy into that seat and who was watching.

12
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:39,470
It starts with a phone call from Washington.

13
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:50,550
But to see why that call mattered, you need to know who picked it up because the man in the leather jacket didn't start at the top.

14
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:52,890
He started in a bathroom in Kentucky.

15
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:55,250
Jensen's story begins in Taiwan.

16
00:00:55,690 --> 00:01:04,050
At nine, he and his older brother were put on a plane to relatives in America To pay for a good school, his parents sold almost everything they owned.

17
00:01:04,209 --> 00:01:07,790
Oneida Baptist Institute, a boarding school in Kentucky.

18
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:09,130
Very strict.

19
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:10,890
Strict is good.

20
00:01:11,090 --> 00:01:12,810
It wasn't a fancy boarding school.

21
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:17,590
It was a reform school for troubled kids and the relatives had signed them up by mistake.

